From: FydeTab Duo NixOS
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: rockchip: drop unreachable FydeTab VOP OPP

The FydeTab Duo's vdd_log_s0 regulator is constrained to 750 mV, while the
shared RK3588 VOP 850 MHz OPP requires 800 mV. The OPP core rejects that
point at probe time. Mark it unavailable on this board instead of advertising
a frequency its regulator cannot supply.

---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588s-fydetab_duo.dts | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588s-fydetab_duo.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588s-fydetab_duo.dts
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588s-fydetab_duo.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588s-fydetab_duo.dts
@@ -675,6 +675,12 @@
   vop-supply = <&vdd_log_s0>;
 };
 
+&vop_opp_table {
+  opp-8500000000 {
+    status = "disabled";
+  };
+};
+
 &vop_mmu {
   status = "okay";
 };
